  "plain": "The German poet Goethe is said to have had an experience of merging with Strasbourg Cathedral, feeling himself become one with the building. Michels tells this drawing on the thinker Rudolf Steiner and a work on Goethe's theory of knowledge, as an example of a way of knowing the world from the inside."
